---
layout: base.njk
title: About Sport Safety
description: "Mission, governance, and policy framework for sport safety in Singapore."
---
<div class="wrap" style="padding-top:1.5rem;">
  <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About Sport Safety</p>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About Sport Safety</h1>
    <p class="lede">How organisations structure safety policy, governance, and shared responsibility across their sport ecosystem.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% for row in about %}
  {% if row.type == "Framework" %}
    <section>
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:2rem; align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <h2>{{ row.section }}</h2>
          {% for para in row.body.split('\n\n') %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <img src="{{ row.image }}" alt="Diagram of the safety framework tiers: governance, policy, operations, practice">
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Policies</h2>
    <div class="grid-cards cols-2">
      {% for row in about %}
        {% if row.type == "Policy" %}
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{{ row.section }}</h3>
            {% for para in row.body.split('\n\n') %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
            <a class="link" href="{{ row.link }}">View document →</a>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    {% for row in about %}
      {% if row.type == "Narrative" %}
        <h2>{{ row.section }}</h2>
        {% for para in row.body.split('\n\n') %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="list-row"><span>Sport safety enquiries</span><a class="link" href="/faq/">See FAQ &amp; Support →</a></div>
    <div class="list-row"><span>Urgent safety escalation</span><a class="link" href="/report/">Report an Incident/Hazard →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
